{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00883","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 芳树 · 罗隐","name":"鼓吹曲辞 芳树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细蘂慢逐风，暖香闲破鼻。\n青帝固有心，时时动人意。\n去年高枝犹压地，今年低枝已顦顇。\n吾所以见造化之权，变通之理。\n春夏作头，秋冬爲尾。\n循环反覆无穷已，今生长短同一轨。\n若使威可以制，力可以止，秦皇不肯敛手下沙丘，孟贲不合低头入蒿里。\n伊人强猛犹如此，顾我劳生何足恃？\n但愿开素袍，倾绿蚁，陶陶兀兀大醉於青冥白昼间。\n任他上是天，下是地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}